{
  "info": {
    "name": "SALUD · Paciente",
    "description": "Recorrido de un usuario **paciente**, en orden y encadenado por el entorno.\n\nAutoregistro público, sesión con documento de identidad, verificación de identidad y datos propios. Es el único actor que inicia sesión con su documento y no con un correo.\n\nImportar junto a `Salud-Paciente.postman_environment.json` y correr los pasos de arriba abajo. Cada actor tiene su propio entorno: con uno solo, iniciar sesión como otro borraría este token.\n\nLos pasos son los mismos que ejercita `test/smoke/modules/paciente.smoke.ts` contra la API real, y `yarn postman:verify:actores` los vuelve a correr sobre esta colección.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1 · Se registra solo, sin admin ni token",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/iam/auth/register-patient",
          "host": [
            "{{baseUrl}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "iam",
            "auth",
            "register-patient"
          ],
          "variable": []
        },
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"nationalId\": \"{{nationalId}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{password}}\",\n  \"displayName\": \"Paciente de prueba\",\n  \"phone\": \"+591 70055555\",\n  \"gender\": \"MALE\",\n  \"sexAtBirth\": \"MALE\"\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        },
        "auth": {
          "type": "noauth"
        },
        "description": "Alta pública. El pre-request fija el documento en el entorno para que el login del paso 2 use exactamente el mismo, y para que reejecutar no choque con el 409 de documento en uso."
      },
      "response": [],
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "prerequest",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.environment.set('nationalId', 'CI-' + Date.now());"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('status 201', function () {",
              "  pm.response.to.have.status(201);",
              "});",
              "",
              "// Encadena el recorrido: lo que deja este paso lo consume el siguiente.",
              "if (pm.response.code < 300) {",
              "  const b = pm.response.json();",
              "  if (b.userId) pm.environment.set('patientUserId', b.userId);",
              "  if (b.personId) pm.environment.set('personId', b.personId);",
              "  if (b.patientProfileId) pm.environment.set('patientProfileId', b.patientProfileId);",
              "}"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2 · Inicia sesión con su documento",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/iam/auth/login",
          "host": [
            "{{baseUrl}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "iam",
            "auth",
            "login"
          ],
          "variable": []
        },
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"nationalId\": \"{{nationalId}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{password}}\"\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        },
        "auth": {
          "type": "noauth"
        },
        "description": "El paciente entra con su documento, no con un correo."
      },
      "response": [],
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('status 200', function () {",
              "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
              "});",
              "",
              "// Encadena el recorrido: lo que deja este paso lo consume el siguiente.",
              "if (pm.response.code < 300) {",
              "  const b = pm.response.json();",
              "  if (b.accessToken) pm.environment.set('accessToken', b.accessToken);",
              "  if (b.refreshToken) pm.environment.set('refreshToken', b.refreshToken);",
              "}"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "3 · Sube la foto de su documento",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/common/files",
          "host": [
            "{{baseUrl}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "common",
            "files"
          ],
          "variable": []
        },
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"originalName\": \"documento.jpg\",\n  \"category\": \"DOCUMENT\",\n  \"sensitivity\": \"NORMAL\",\n  \"mimeType\": \"image/jpeg\",\n  \"sizeBytes\": 4096,\n  \"contentHash\": \"pac-{{$timestamp}}\",\n  \"storageUri\": \"s3://bucket/documento.jpg\"\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        },
        "description": "La evidencia con la que se abrirá el caso: sin ella no hay qué contrastar."
      },
      "response": [],
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('status 201', function () {",
              "  pm.response.to.have.status(201);",
              "});",
              "",
              "// Encadena el recorrido: lo que deja este paso lo consume el siguiente.",
              "if (pm.response.code < 300) {",
              "  const b = pm.response.json();",
              "  if (b.id) pm.environment.set('evidenceFileId', b.id);",
              "}"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "4 · Abre su caso de verificación de identidad",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/identity/me/identity-verification",
          "host": [
            "{{baseUrl}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "identity",
            "me",
            "identity-verification"
          ],
          "variable": []
        },
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"evidenceFileId\": \"{{evidenceFileId}}\"\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        },
        "description": ""
      },
      "response": [],
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('status 201', function () {",
              "  pm.response.to.have.status(201);",
              "});",
              "",
              "// Encadena el recorrido: lo que deja este paso lo consume el siguiente.",
              "if (pm.response.code < 300) {",
              "  const b = pm.response.json();",
              "  if (b.id) pm.environment.set('caseId', b.id);",
              "}"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "5 · Lista sus propios casos",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/identity/me/verification-cases",
          "host": [
            "{{baseUrl}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "identity",
            "me",
            "verification-cases"
          ],
          "variable": []
        },
        "description": ""
      },
      "response": [],
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('status 200', function () {",
              "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
              "});"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "6 · Ve el detalle de su caso",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/identity/me/verification-cases/:caseId",
          "host": [
            "{{baseUrl}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "identity",
            "me",
            "verification-cases",
            ":caseId"
          ],
          "variable": [
            {
              "key": "caseId",
              "value": "{{caseId}}",
              "description": "Lo deja en el entorno un paso anterior"
            }
          ]
        },
        "description": "Filtra por id **y** titular: el caso de otro paciente responde 404."
      },
      "response": [],
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('status 200', function () {",
              "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
              "});"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "7 · Registra a su familiar responsable",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/profiles/patients/:patientProfileId/related-persons",
          "host": [
            "{{baseUrl}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "profiles",
            "patients",
            ":patientProfileId",
            "related-persons"
          ],
          "variable": [
            {
              "key": "patientProfileId",
              "value": "{{patientProfileId}}",
              "description": "Lo deja en el entorno un paso anterior"
            }
          ]
        },
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"personId\": \"{{personId}}\",\n  \"displayName\": \"Familiar responsable\",\n  \"isEmergencyContact\": true\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        },
        "description": ""
      },
      "response": [],
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('status 201', function () {",
              "  pm.response.to.have.status(201);",
              "});"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "8 · Cierra su sesión",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/iam/auth/logout",
          "host": [
            "{{baseUrl}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "iam",
            "auth",
            "logout"
          ],
          "variable": []
        },
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"refreshToken\": \"{{refreshToken}}\"\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        },
        "description": ""
      },
      "response": [],
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('status 200', function () {",
              "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
              "});"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{accessToken}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:3000",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ]
}
